;@frames 0 250 4000
; The caches cut to the contract's limits as each frame starts: 16 MiB of
; glyph bitmaps and 8 MiB of composites. Fully transparent events draw large
; bordered glyphs that no image shows, twelve new ones every half second, so
; both caches overflow. Meanwhile one line stays, one moves, one leaves and
; comes back, and an opaque box around U+00A0 gives way to one around a space
; at the same place; what the shown lines were drawn from is still held and
; stays.
